for a specified isotope mass difference.

The default intensity transformation is \code{log2(intensity + 1)}.
With the default peak-count settings, spectra containing fewer than
13 peaks are assigned status \code{"fail"} and a threshold of zero.
See \code{\link[=DenoisingConfigAdaptive]{DenoisingConfigAdaptive()}} for all default settings.
