\code{denoising_method = NA}, and \code{ms2_noise_threshold = 0}.
They remain in the returned object.

The zero threshold is still applied to failed spectra, retaining
only positive finite intensities. Their \code{peaksCount} and
\code{totIonCurrent} metadata are not recalculated, so those fields
